*  RED, CHECKED IN RED (law 0d).  ***THE STANDALONE REPRODUCER OF BEAUTY'S WILD JUMP.***
*  `:($('L' OP))` inside a DEFINE'd proc resolves through rt_goto_transfer -> rt_chain_enter,
*  which pushes 5 callee-saves and wires BOTH gamma and omega back into its own C shim, so the
*  target label runs as a NESTED ACTIVATION.  LADD's `:(RETURN)` then executes the procedure
*  pop-pair (`pop rcx; add rsp,8; jmp rcx`) against THAT frame, pops a saved register / C
*  residue, and jumps to it: rip=_rtld_global, rc=139.  beauty.sno dispatches pp/ss the same
*  way (`$('pp_' t)`, `$('ss_' t)`) and its crash dump is IDENTICAL quad for quad.
        DEFINE('f(OP)')                 :(fmain)
f                                       :($('L' OP))
LADD    OUTPUT = 'op=ADD'               :(RETURN)
fmain   f('ADD')
        OUTPUT = 'back'                 :(END)
END
